{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n今晚（23日）TVB節目《愛．回家之三代同糖》劇情超緊張！車婉婉飾演的嘉冰為幫好友龔喜（樊亦敏飾）克服潔癖，竟犧牲自己瞓在污糟後巷上演「脫敏療法」。沒想到計劃中途突生變故，嘉冰慘遭仇家以刀挾持，生死一線間，究竟她能否脫險？\n</p>\n<h2>車婉婉上演脫敏療法 糞不顧身瞓污糟後巷</h2>\n<p>劇情講述嘉冰（車婉婉飾）因無法忍受好友龔喜（樊亦敏飾）的嚴重潔癖，決定出動「脫敏療法」以毒攻毒。她精心設計，刻意引龔喜走進一條布滿污水、蟑螂、雀鳥糞便與垃圾的超污糟後巷。為了讓龔喜突破心理關口，嘉冰更上演一幕「糞」不顧身，假裝失足重重跌在骯髒的地上，並裝出楚楚可憐的樣子，希望引龔喜上前攙扶。一邊是演技大爆發的嘉冰，另一邊卻是滿臉嫌棄、進退兩難的龔喜，強烈的反差營造出爆笑效果。</p>\n<h2>劇情急轉直下 嘉冰突遭仇家唐嘉麟挾持</h2>\n<p>正當嘉冰的「脫敏大計」進行得如火如荼，劇情卻180度大轉變！嘉冰的「仇家」Brian（唐嘉麟飾）突然從後巷暗處殺出，不由分說便從後埋伏，更亮出利刀挾持嘉冰，場面瞬間由搞笑變為極度緊張。這突如其來的變故，不僅讓嘉冰陷入生死危機，更讓站在一旁、有嚴重潔癖的龔喜面臨友情與潔癖之間的終極人性考驗，氣氛推至最高潮。</p>\n<h2>揭樊亦敏潔癖天花板行為 全屋霧化除菌嚇壞人</h2>\n<p>其實嘉冰之所以要出此下策，全因龔喜的潔癖已達「天花板」級別，令身邊人苦不堪言。早前劇情就交代，龔喜因不滿好友唐芯（李茵彤飾）帶朋友回家開派對弄髒地方，竟與朱基 KC（歐瑞偉飾）穿上全副保護衣為全屋消毒。之後她更在屋企大搞霧化除菌，令全屋煙霧瀰漫，程度直逼香火鼎盛的寺廟，逼得唐芯要戴上氧氣罩「保命」，行為極度誇張，難怪嘉冰要出手相救。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚劇情緊張：估唔到咁刺激！</h2>\n<p>今集劇情由搞笑急轉為緊張，引起網民熱烈討論，不少人對車婉婉被挾持一幕感到驚訝，大讚劇情充滿追看性。「頭半段仲笑緊樊亦敏潔癖，點知後面變咗警匪片！」、「車婉婉為朋友真係好偉大，竟然肯瞓喺條咁污糟嘅巷！」、「唐嘉麟一出嚟用刀挾持嗰下真係嚇親，好緊張！」、「好想知樊亦敏會點揀，究竟係救朋友定係繼續怕污糟？」、「今集劇情有笑有淚有刺激，追得好過癮！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_10477031066b03bdffb1972.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_10477031066b03bdffb1972.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_15359302716b03be084fa94.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_15359302716b03be084fa94.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_21240931586b03be0eee9fd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_21240931586b03be0eee9fd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_21146847536b03be1ca0a59.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_21146847536b03be1ca0a59.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_14421122516b03be2c7654d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_14421122516b03be2c7654d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_16349091076b03be3349479.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_16349091076b03be3349479.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_8540374986b03be438854e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_8540374986b03be438854e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_4592824096b03be4bcf188.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_4592824096b03be4bcf188.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.232041+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1176,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T09:00:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:23.329101+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:23.329101+00:00","content_hash":"39ad109a38f510fe27e44f8451e94cdf875991ef07962155f4f6141bb6675fa4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}